---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/siteUrl';
---

<Layout title="Contribute" description="Contribute to Varve: code, documentation, testing, and design. All contributions are welcome — the source is available on GitHub under FSL-1.1-MIT.">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="contribute-page">
      <h1>Contribute to Varve</h1>
      <p class="contribute-intro">
        Varve is community-shaped. Whether you contribute code, documentation, testing, or design, your help is valued and appreciated.
      </p>
      <p class="contribute-intro">
        <strong>Varve is not yet accepting external contributions.</strong> The page below describes the process we intend to use once the project opens up. In the meantime, feedback and ideas are welcome in <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/discussions">GitHub Discussions</a>.
      </p>

      <section class="contribute-section">
        <h2>Ways to Contribute</h2>
        
        <div class="contribute-cards">
          <div class="contribute-card">
            <h3>Code Contributions</h3>
            <p>Fix bugs, add features, improve performance</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Read the <a href={sitePath('/contribute/guidelines')}>contribution guidelines</a></li>
              <li>Set up development environment (see <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/blob/main/AGENTS.md">AGENTS.md</a>)</li>
              <li>Check for "good first issue" labels on GitHub</li>
              <li>Submit pull requests with tests</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="contribute-card">
            <h3>Documentation</h3>
            <p>Improve docs, write tutorials, translate content</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Fix typos or clarify confusing sections</li>
              <li>Write tutorials for specific workflows</li>
              <li>Add examples and screenshots</li>
              <li>Translate documentation to other languages</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="contribute-card">
            <h3>Testing</h3>
            <p>Test on different platforms and report bugs</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Test on specific Linux distributions</li>
              <li>Test on different macOS versions</li>
              <li>Test accessibility with screen readers</li>
              <li>Verify bug fixes and report regressions</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="contribute-card">
            <h3>Design</h3>
            <p>Create UI mockups, icons, website improvements</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Design new feature interfaces</li>
              <li>Create icon designs</li>
              <li>Improve website UX</li>
              <li>Design marketing materials</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contribute-section">
        <h2>Getting Started</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Read the <a href={sitePath('/contribute/guidelines')}>contribution guidelines</a> and code of conduct</li>
          <li>Set up your development environment following <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/blob/main/AGENTS.md">AGENTS.md</a></li>
          <li>Check existing issues for "good first issue" labels</li>
          <li>Fork the repository and create a feature branch</li>
          <li>Make your changes and add tests</li>
          <li>Submit a pull request with a clear description</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="contribute-section">
        <h2>Contribution Licensing</h2>
        <p>
          Once open, all contributions to Varve will need to be licensed under FSL-1.1-MIT. By contributing, you will grant a license for your code to be included in the project under the same license. You retain copyright to your contributions.
        </p>
        <p>
          All contributions require a <a href="https://developercertificate.org/">Developer Certificate of Origin</a> (DCO) sign-off. See <a href={sitePath('/contribute/guidelines')}>the contribution guidelines</a> for details.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="contribute-section">
        <h2>Recognition</h2>
        <p>
          Contributors are recognized in the following ways:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>GitHub contributor list (automatic)</li>
          <li>Release notes acknowledgment (with permission)</li>
          <li>Contributors section on the About page</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <div class="contribute-cta">
        <h2>Want to know when contributions open?</h2>
        <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/varve/discussions" class="btn-primary">Follow GitHub Discussions</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .contribute-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .contribute-page h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-family: var(--font-editorial);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .contribute-intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .contribute-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-card {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  
  .contribute-card p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .contribute-card ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  
  .contribute-card li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .contribute-card li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-link-hover);
  }
  
  .contribute-section ol {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: item;
  }
  
  .contribute-section ol li {
    counter-increment: item;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .contribute-section ol li::before {
    content: counter(item);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--status-built);
    color: var(--text-on-status);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  .contribute-section ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  
  .contribute-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .contribute-section li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-link-hover);
  }
  
  .contribute-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-default);
  }
  
  .contribute-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
